TEXT 0 -128 Left 2 ;PRECHARGE, RPRE1 SWEEP (no load): battery connect at t=0, contactor across RPRE1 (J13-J14) open the whole run
TEXT 736 -64 Left 2 ;RPRE1 (swept)
TEXT 1088 -64 Left 2 ;MAIN RAIL BULK + LOAD
TEXT 1440 -64 Left 2 ;ACTUATOR BRANCHES (4 x 100u)
TEXT 896 392 Left 2 ;;U_LOAD = load watts during precharge\n;(0 = off), turns on above Von
TEXT 0 448 Left 2 !.tran 0 2 0 50u\n.include precharge_models.lib\n.param Vbatt=48 Rbatt=20m Lcab=1u Rf100=0.44m Rf50=1.03m\n.param Cbus=2.82m Cact=100u Rharn=10m Lharn=500n\n.param Pload=0 Von=30\n* sweep: Rpre is defined here only\n.step param Rpre list 2.2 4.7 10 22 47 100\n* charge time, measured from battery connect at t=0\n.meas TRAN t90 WHEN V(bus)=0.90*V(batt) TD=100u RISE=1\n.meas TRAN t95 WHEN V(bus)=0.95*V(batt) TD=100u RISE=1\n.meas TRAN t99 WHEN V(bus)=0.99*V(batt) TD=100u RISE=1\n.meas TRAN Vbus_end FIND V(bus) AT 1.99\n* stress on RPRE1\n.meas TRAN Ipk   MAX -I(RPRE1)\n.meas TRAN Ppk   MAX -V(fuse,bus)*I(RPRE1)\n.meas TRAN E_pre INTEG -V(fuse,bus)*I(RPRE1)\n* fuse: compare to BF1 melting I2t (100A: 42500 A2s)\n.meas TRAN I2t_F1 INTEG I(F1)*I(F1)
TEXT 1056 1024 Left 2 ;Results: View > SPICE Output Log (right-click > Plot .step'ed .meas data)\n;t95/t99 FAIL if the bus never gets there (load stalls the precharge)
